{
  "title": "Salawat upon Lady Fatimah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى الصِّدِّيْقَةِ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّكِيَّةِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI ALAS SIDDEEQATE FAATIMATAZ ZAKEEYAH\nO Allah, send blessings upon the veracious and immaculate lady Fatimah,\nحَبِيْبَةِ حَبِيْبِكَ وَ نَبِيِّكَ\nHABEEBATE HABEEBIKA WA NABIYYIKA\nthe most beloved of Your beloved and Your Prophet,\nوَ اُمِّ اَحِبَّاۤئِكَ وَ اَصْفِيَاۤئِكَ\nWA UMME AHIBBAA-IKA WA ASFIYAA-IKA\nand the mother of Your dearest and choicest ones,\nالَّتِيْ انْتَجَبْتَهَا وَ فَضَّلْتَهَا وَ اخْتَرْتَهَا عَلٰى نِسَاۤءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nALLATEE INTAJABTAHAA WA FAZZALTAHAA WAKHTARTAHAA ALAA NESAA-IL AALAMEEN\nwhom You have selected, given preference to, and chosen over the women of the worlds.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ كُنِ الطَّالِبَ لَهَا مِمَّنْ ظَلَمَهَا وَ اسْتَخَفَّ بِحَقِّهَا\nALLAAHUMMA KUNIT TAALEBA LAHAA MIMMAN ZALAMAHAA WASTAKHAFFA BEHAQQEHAA\nO Allah, be her claimant against those who wronged her and belittled her right,\nوَ كُنِ الثَّاۤئِرَ اللّٰهُمَّ بِدَمِ اَوْلَادِهَا\nWA KUNITH THAA-ERA ALLAAHUMMA BEDAME AWLAADEHAA\nand be, O Allah, the Avenger of the blood of her children.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ كَمَا جَعَلْتَهَاۤ اُمَّ اَئِمَّةِ الْهُدٰى\nALLAAHUMMA WA KAMAA JA-ALTAHAA UMMA A-EMMATIL HUDAA\nO Allah, and just as You made her the mother of the Imams of guidance,\nوَ حَلِيْلَةَ صَاحِبِ اللِّوَاۤءِ وَ الْكَرِيْمَةَ عِنْدَ الْمَلَاِ الْاَعْلٰى\nWA HALEELATA SAAHEBIL LIWAA-E WAL KAREEMATA I'NDAL MALA-IL A'-LAA\nthe spouse of the Bearer of the Banner, and the most honored one before the Highest Assembly,\nفَصَلِّ عَلَيْهَا وَ عَلٰى اُمِّهَا صَلٰوةً تُكْرِمُ بِهَا وَجْهَ مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ اٰلِهِ\nFASALLI ALAYHAA WA ALAA UMMEHAA SALAATAN TUKREMO BEHAA WAJHA MOHAMMADIN SALLAL LAAHO ALAYHE WA AALEH\nso send upon her and upon her mother such blessings as would honor the face of Muhammad — Allah's blessings be upon him and his Household —\nوَ تُقِرُّ بِهَاۤ اَعْيُنَ ذُرِّيَّتِهَا\nWA TUQERRO BEHAA A'YONA ZURRIYYATEHAA\nand delight the eyes of her offspring thereby.\nوَ اَبْلِغْهُمْ عَنِّيْ فِيْ هٰذِهِ السَّاعَةِ اَفْضَلَ التَّحِيَّةِ وَ السَّلَامِ\nWA ABLIGHHUM A'NNEE FEE HAAZIHIS SAA-A'TE AFZALAT TAHIYYATE WAS SALAAM\nAnd convey to them from me, at this very hour, the best of greetings and peace."
}
